<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Two firms raise First Bank.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Two firms raise First Bank.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it upgraded First Bank System Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it raised the stock to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday First Bank said it will acquire U.S. Bancorp in a deal worth more than $8.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 2-3/8 to 77-7/8.</p>
</text>
